      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786381768337,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🦷 Scenario: Booking a Dentist Appointment\n\nSituation:\nYou have had a toothache for the last two days. You call the dental clinic to book an appointment.\n\nReceptionist: Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\n\nYou: Good morning. I’d like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\n\nReceptionist: Of course. Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\n\nYou: No, I’ve been there before.\n\nReceptionist: Okay. Can I take your name and date of birth, please?\n\nYou: Yes, it’s [Your Name] and [Your dob].\n\nReceptionist: Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\n\nYou: I’ve had a toothache for the last two days, and it’s getting worse.\n\nReceptionist: I’m sorry to hear that. Are you experiencing any swelling or severe pain?\n\nYou: I have some pain, especially when I eat or drink something cold.\n\nReceptionist: I see. Let me check the dentist’s availability. We have an appointment tomorrow at 10:30 am or Thursday at 3:00 pm.\n\nYou: Tomorrow at 10:30 am would be great.\n\nReceptionist: Perfect. Could I have your phone number, please?\n\nYou: Sure. It’s [Your Phone Number].\n\nReceptionist: Thank you. Your appointment is booked for tomorrow at 10:30 am with Dr Smith.\n\nYou: Okay, thank you. Is there anything I need to bring?\n\nReceptionist: Please bring your ID and any relevant medical or dental information.\n\nYou: No problem. Thank you for your help.\n\nReceptionist: You’re very welcome. We’ll see you tomorrow at 10:30 am.\n\nYou: Thank you. Goodbye.\n\nReceptionist: Goodbye.",
      "fontSize": 40.208614929499134,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🦷 Scenario: Booking a Dentist Appointment\n\nSituation:\nYou have had a toothache for the last two days. You call the dental clinic to book an appointment.\n\nReceptionist: Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\n\nYou: Good morning. I’d like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\n\nReceptionist: Of course. Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\n\nYou: No, I’ve been there before.\n\nReceptionist: Okay. Can I take your name and date of birth, please?\n\nYou: Yes, it’s [Your Name] and [Your dob].\n\nReceptionist: Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\n\nYou: I’ve had a toothache for the last two days, and it’s getting worse.\n\nReceptionist: I’m sorry to hear that. Are you experiencing any swelling or severe pain?\n\nYou: I have some pain, especially when I eat or drink something cold.\n\nReceptionist: I see. Let me check the dentist’s availability. We have an appointment tomorrow at 10:30 am or Thursday at 3:00 pm.\n\nYou: Tomorrow at 10:30 am would be great.\n\nReceptionist: Perfect. Could I have your phone number, please?\n\nYou: Sure. It’s [Your Phone Number].\n\nReceptionist: Thank you. Your appointment is booked for tomorrow at 10:30 am with Dr Smith.\n\nYou: Okay, thank you. Is there anything I need to bring?\n\nReceptionist: Please bring your ID and any relevant medical or dental information.\n\nYou: No problem. Thank you for your help.\n\nReceptionist: You’re very welcome. We’ll see you tomorrow at 10:30 am.\n\nYou: Thank you. Goodbye.\n\nReceptionist: Goodbye.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LEyRH1yz7z-NPqDxlNLC_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9365.131053336256,
      "y": -4859.57125661007,
      "width": 1564.198974609375,
      "height": 990,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 581252785,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 983774367,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786302588112,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Parse date_str → get day-of-week code\n      day_of_week = DAY_CODES[weekday of date_str]   e.g. Monday → \"MON\"\n\n2. Query doctor_working_hours\n      SELECT start_time, end_time\n      WHERE doctor_id = ? AND day_of_week = ?\n\n   ├─ No row found?\n   │     → return (None, \"Doctor does not work this day\")   [STOP]\n   │\n   └─ Row found (hours) → continue\n\n3. Query doctor_time_off\n      SELECT 1 WHERE doctor_id = ? AND date_str BETWEEN start_date AND end_date\n\n   ├─ Row found (date falls inside a time-off range)?\n   │     → return (None, \"Doctor is off this day\")   [STOP]\n   │\n   └─ No row found → continue\n\n4. return (hours, None)\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Parse date_str → get day-of-week code\n      day_of_week = DAY_CODES[weekday of date_str]   e.g. Monday → \"MON\"\n\n2. Query doctor_working_hours\n      SELECT start_time, end_time\n      WHERE doctor_id = ? AND day_of_week = ?\n\n   ├─ No row found?\n   │     → return (None, \"Doctor does not work this day\")   [STOP]\n   │\n   └─ Row found (hours) → continue\n\n3. Query doctor_time_off\n      SELECT 1 WHERE doctor_id = ? AND date_str BETWEEN start_date AND end_date\n\n   ├─ Row found (date falls inside a time-off range)?\n   │     → return (None, \"Doctor is off this day\")   [STOP]\n   │\n   └─ No row found → continue\n\n4. return (hours, None)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
