      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "==================================================================\n   BOOKING A DENTIST APPOINTMENT -- call flow\n   booking_service/app/main.py\n==================================================================\n\nSTART: phone rings\n[REC] \"Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\"\n[YOU] \"I'd like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\"\n    |\n    v\n[REC] \"Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\"\n[YOU] \"No, I've been there before.\"   /   \"Yes, this is my first time.\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          v\n[REC] \"Okay. Can I take your name          [REC] \"Okay, could I get your\n       and date of birth, please?\"                name and date of birth?\"\n[YOU] \"Yes, it's [Name] and [DOB].\"       [YOU] \"Sure -- [Name], [DOB].\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          |\n+-----------------------------+                |\n| find-patient(first,last,dob)|                |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/         |                |\n|        find-patient         |                |\n+-----------------------------+                |\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          |\nusualDoctorId present?                         |\n    |            |                             |\n   yes           no                            |\n    |            |                             |\n    v            +---------------+-------------+\n+-----------+                    |\n| get-doctor|              [REC] \"Do you have a preferred dentist?\"\n| (doctorId)|              [YOU] \"Anyone is fine.\"\n| ROUTE:    |                    |\n| POST      |                    v\n| /tools/   |            (no lookup call yet -- which doctor you\n| get-doctor|             get is resolved together with the\n+-----------+             availability search further down)\n    |                            |\n    v                            |\n[REC] \"I see you've been         |\n treated by Dr Smith             |\n before.\"                        |\n[YOU] \"Yes, that's right.\"       |\n    |                            |\n    +--------------+-------------+\n                   |\n                   v  (doctorId settled for the returning branch;\n                       \"anyone is fine\" branch still open)\n\n[REC] \"Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\"\n[YOU] \"I've had a toothache for the last two days, and it's getting worse.\"\n[REC] \"Any swelling or severe pain?\"\n[YOU] \"Some pain, especially with hot or cold food and drink.\"\n    |   (carried forward as the `reason` field on book-appointment --\n    |    no fetch call of its own)\n    v\n[REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n    |\n    +-------------------------------+------------------------------+\n    |                                                               |\n    v (usualDoctorId branch)                                       v (\"anyone is fine\" branch)\n+-----------------------------------+              +-----------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,  |              | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,      |\n|   dateFrom=today,                  |              |   dateFrom=today,                     |\n|   dateTo=end of this week)         |              |   dateTo=end of this week)            |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/                |              | ROUTE: POST /tools/                   |\n|   find-next-opening                |              |   find-next-opening                   |\n+-----------------------------------+              +-----------------------------------+\n    |                                                               |\n    v                                                               v\nfound: true this week?                                    [REC] \"We have an opening\n    |            |                                                Friday at 11:00am\n   yes           no                                               with Dr Lee.\"\n    |            |\n    v            v\n[REC] reports  [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything\n this week's    open this week -- would you like to\n slot, e.g.     wait until next week, or see another\n \"We have       dentist sooner?\"\n tomorrow at        |\n 10:30am.\"          +-------------------+\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |          \"I'd like to see    \"Next week is\n    |           someone sooner.\"    fine, thanks.\"\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |     +-------------------+  +-------------------------+\n    |     | find-next-opening   |  | find-next-opening         |\n    |     | (doctorId=None,     |  | (doctorId=usual,          |\n    |     |  dateFrom=today,    |  |  dateFrom=start of next wk,|\n    |     |  dateTo=end of wk)  |  |  dateTo=end of next wk)   |\n    |     +-------------------+  +-------------------------+\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |     [REC] \"Dr Lee has an   [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n    |      opening this          is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n    |      Friday at 11am.\"\n    |                |                   |\n    +----------------+-------------------+\n                     |\n                     v\n[YOU] \"That works, thanks.\"\n        (picks slot -- no backend call)\n    |\n    v\n[REC] \"Could I have your phone number, please?\"\n[YOU] \"Sure, it's [Phone Number].\"\n    |\n    +---------------------------+\n    |                           |\n    v (returning patient)       v (first-time patient)\n+---------------------------+  +------------------------------+\n| update-patient-phone      |  | register-patient(first,last,  |\n| (patientId, phone)        |  |   dob, phone)                 |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/       |  | ROUTE: POST /tools/           |\n|   update-patient-phone    |  |   register-patient            |\n+---------------------------+  +------------------------------+\n    |                           |\n    +--------------+-------------+\n                   |\n                   v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n| book-appointment(patientId, doctorId, date, startTime,      |\n|   durationMinutes, appointmentType, reason)                  |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/book-appointment                          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n    |\n    +--------------------------------+\n    |                                |\n    v                                v\nbooked: false                    booked: true\n  reasons:                            |\n  - \"No doctor found with that ID\"    v\n  - \"No patient found with that ID\"  [REC] \"Thank you. Your appointment is\n  - \"Requested time falls outside      booked for [date] at [time]\n     the doctor's working hours\"       with Dr [Name].\"\n  - \"That time overlaps an existing          |\n     appointment for this doctor.           [YOU] \"Okay, thank you. Is there\n     Please choose another.\"                        anything I need to bring?\"\n  - \"This patient already has                  |\n     another appointment at that       [REC] \"Please bring your ID and any\n     time.\" (NEW -- excl_patient_             relevant medical or dental\n     overlap constraint)                      information.\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                   [YOU] \"No problem. Thank you\n  back to find-next-opening                    for your help.\"\n  (pick a different date/slot)                 |\n                                         [REC] \"You're very welcome. We'll\n                                                see you then.\"\n                                                |\n                                         [YOU] \"Thank you. Goodbye.\"\n                                         [REC] \"Goodbye.\"\n                                                |\n                                                v\n                                              DONE\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==================================================================\n   BOOKING A DENTIST APPOINTMENT -- call flow\n   booking_service/app/main.py\n==================================================================\n\nSTART: phone rings\n[REC] \"Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\"\n[YOU] \"I'd like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\"\n    |\n    v\n[REC] \"Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\"\n[YOU] \"No, I've been there before.\"   /   \"Yes, this is my first time.\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          v\n[REC] \"Okay. Can I take your name          [REC] \"Okay, could I get your\n       and date of birth, please?\"                name and date of birth?\"\n[YOU] \"Yes, it's [Name] and [DOB].\"       [YOU] \"Sure -- [Name], [DOB].\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          |\n+-----------------------------+                |\n| find-patient(first,last,dob)|                |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/         |                |\n|        find-patient         |                |\n+-----------------------------+                |\n    |                                          |\n    v                                          |\nusualDoctorId present?                         |\n    |            |                             |\n   yes           no                            |\n    |            |                             |\n    v            +---------------+-------------+\n+-----------+                    |\n| get-doctor|              [REC] \"Do you have a preferred dentist?\"\n| (doctorId)|              [YOU] \"Anyone is fine.\"\n| ROUTE:    |                    |\n| POST      |                    v\n| /tools/   |            (no lookup call yet -- which doctor you\n| get-doctor|             get is resolved together with the\n+-----------+             availability search further down)\n    |                            |\n    v                            |\n[REC] \"I see you've been         |\n treated by Dr Smith             |\n before.\"                        |\n[YOU] \"Yes, that's right.\"       |\n    |                            |\n    +--------------+-------------+\n                   |\n                   v  (doctorId settled for the returning branch;\n                       \"anyone is fine\" branch still open)\n\n[REC] \"Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\"\n[YOU] \"I've had a toothache for the last two days, and it's getting worse.\"\n[REC] \"Any swelling or severe pain?\"\n[YOU] \"Some pain, especially with hot or cold food and drink.\"\n    |   (carried forward as the `reason` field on book-appointment --\n    |    no fetch call of its own)\n    v\n[REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n    |\n    +-------------------------------+------------------------------+\n    |                                                               |\n    v (usualDoctorId branch)                                       v (\"anyone is fine\" branch)\n+-----------------------------------+              +-----------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,  |              | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,      |\n|   dateFrom=today,                  |              |   dateFrom=today,                     |\n|   dateTo=end of this week)         |              |   dateTo=end of this week)            |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/                |              | ROUTE: POST /tools/                   |\n|   find-next-opening                |              |   find-next-opening                   |\n+-----------------------------------+              +-----------------------------------+\n    |                                                               |\n    v                                                               v\nfound: true this week?                                    [REC] \"We have an opening\n    |            |                                                Friday at 11:00am\n   yes           no                                               with Dr Lee.\"\n    |            |\n    v            v\n[REC] reports  [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything\n this week's    open this week -- would you like to\n slot, e.g.     wait until next week, or see another\n \"We have       dentist sooner?\"\n tomorrow at        |\n 10:30am.\"          +-------------------+\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |          \"I'd like to see    \"Next week is\n    |           someone sooner.\"    fine, thanks.\"\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |     +-------------------+  +-------------------------+\n    |     | find-next-opening   |  | find-next-opening         |\n    |     | (doctorId=None,     |  | (doctorId=usual,          |\n    |     |  dateFrom=today,    |  |  dateFrom=start of next wk,|\n    |     |  dateTo=end of wk)  |  |  dateTo=end of next wk)   |\n    |     +-------------------+  +-------------------------+\n    |                |                   |\n    |                v                   v\n    |     [REC] \"Dr Lee has an   [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n    |      opening this          is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n    |      Friday at 11am.\"\n    |                |                   |\n    +----------------+-------------------+\n                     |\n                     v\n[YOU] \"That works, thanks.\"\n        (picks slot -- no backend call)\n    |\n    v\n[REC] \"Could I have your phone number, please?\"\n[YOU] \"Sure, it's [Phone Number].\"\n    |\n    +---------------------------+\n    |                           |\n    v (returning patient)       v (first-time patient)\n+---------------------------+  +------------------------------+\n| update-patient-phone      |  | register-patient(first,last,  |\n| (patientId, phone)        |  |   dob, phone)                 |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/       |  | ROUTE: POST /tools/           |\n|   update-patient-phone    |  |   register-patient            |\n+---------------------------+  +------------------------------+\n    |                           |\n    +--------------+-------------+\n                   |\n                   v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n| book-appointment(patientId, doctorId, date, startTime,      |\n|   durationMinutes, appointmentType, reason)                  |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/book-appointment                          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n    |\n    +--------------------------------+\n    |                                |\n    v                                v\nbooked: false                    booked: true\n  reasons:                            |\n  - \"No doctor found with that ID\"    v\n  - \"No patient found with that ID\"  [REC] \"Thank you. Your appointment is\n  - \"Requested time falls outside      booked for [date] at [time]\n     the doctor's working hours\"       with Dr [Name].\"\n  - \"That time overlaps an existing          |\n     appointment for this doctor.           [YOU] \"Okay, thank you. Is there\n     Please choose another.\"                        anything I need to bring?\"\n  - \"This patient already has                  |\n     another appointment at that       [REC] \"Please bring your ID and any\n     time.\" (NEW -- excl_patient_             relevant medical or dental\n     overlap constraint)                      information.\"\n    |                                          |\n    v                                   [YOU] \"No problem. Thank you\n  back to find-next-opening                    for your help.\"\n  (pick a different date/slot)                 |\n                                         [REC] \"You're very welcome. We'll\n                                                see you then.\"\n                                                |\n                                         [YOU] \"Thank you. Goodbye.\"\n                                         [REC] \"Goodbye.\"\n                                                |\n                                                v\n                                              DONE\n",
