      "updated": 1786357929166,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n    |\n    v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week,   |\n|   doctorId=usualDoctorId)                                     |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening                          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n    |\n    v\nfound: true this week?\n    |                  |\n   yes                 no\n    |                  |\n    v                  v\n[REC] reports slot   [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything open\n e.g. \"We have         this week -- would you like to wait\n tomorrow at 10:30am\"  until next week, or see another dentist\n                       sooner?\"\n                           |\n                +----------+----------+\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n        \"sooner, please\"      \"next week's fine\"\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n   +--------------------------+  +--------------------------+\n   | find-next-opening         |  | find-next-opening          |\n   | (dateFrom=today,          |  | (dateFrom=start of next wk,|\n   |  dateTo=end of this week, |  |  dateTo=end of next week,  |\n   |  doctorId=None)           |  |  doctorId=usualDoctorId)   |\n   | -- any doctor, this week  |  | -- usual doctor, next week |\n   +--------------------------+  +--------------------------+\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n      [REC] \"Dr Lee has an     [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n       opening Friday 11am.\"    is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n    |\n    v\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week,   |\n|   doctorId=usualDoctorId)                                     |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening                          |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------+\n    |\n    v\nfound: true this week?\n    |                  |\n   yes                 no\n    |                  |\n    v                  v\n[REC] reports slot   [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything open\n e.g. \"We have         this week -- would you like to wait\n tomorrow at 10:30am\"  until next week, or see another dentist\n                       sooner?\"\n                           |\n                +----------+----------+\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n        \"sooner, please\"      \"next week's fine\"\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n   +--------------------------+  +--------------------------+\n   | find-next-opening         |  | find-next-opening          |\n   | (dateFrom=today,          |  | (dateFrom=start of next wk,|\n   |  dateTo=end of this week, |  |  dateTo=end of next week,  |\n   |  doctorId=None)           |  |  doctorId=usualDoctorId)   |\n   | -- any doctor, this week  |  | -- usual doctor, next week |\n   +--------------------------+  +--------------------------+\n                |                     |\n                v                     v\n      [REC] \"Dr Lee has an     [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n       opening Friday 11am.\"    is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n",
