      "updated": 1787065813592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "==================================================================\n   BOOKING A DENTIST APPOINTMENT \n   booking_service/app/main.py\n==================================================================\n\nSTART: phone rings\n  |\n  v\n[REC] \"Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\"\n[YOU] \"I'd like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\"\n  |\n  v\n[REC] \"Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\"\n  |\n  +---------------------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | \"No, I've been there before.\"   | \"Yes, this is my first time.\"   |\n  v                                 v\nRETURNING PATIENT                  FIRST-TIME PATIENT\n  |                                 |\n  v                                 v\n[REC] \"Okay. Can I take your        [REC] \"Do you have a preferred\n       name and date of birth,             dentist?\"\n       please?\"                     [YOU] \"Anyone is fine.\"\n[YOU] \"Yes, it's [Name] and                |\n       [DOB].\"                             v\n  |                                  (no lookup call yet -- which doctor\n  v                                  you get is resolved together with\n+---------------------------------+  the availability search further\n| find-patient(first, last, dob)  |  down. Name/DOB aren't needed yet\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-patient |  either -- first-time patients skip\n+---------------------------------+  find-patient entirely, so there's\n  |                                  nothing to ask for until\n  v                                  register-patient, further down.)\nusualDoctorId present?                     |\n  |            |                           |\n yes           no                          |\n  |            |                           |\n  v            +---------------------------+\n+-------------------------------+          |\n| get-doctor(doctorId)          |          |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/get-doctor |          |\n+-------------------------------+          |\n  |                                        |\n  v                                        |\n[REC] \"I see you've been treated           |\n       by Dr Smith before.\"                |\n[YOU] \"Yes, that's right.\"                 |\n  |                                        |\n  +--------------------+-------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n        (doctorId settled for the returning branch;\n         \"anyone is fine\" branch still open)\n                       |\n                       v\n        [REC] \"Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\"\n        [YOU] \"I've had a toothache for the last two days,\n               and it's getting worse.\"\n        [REC] \"Any swelling or severe pain?\"\n        [YOU] \"Some pain, especially with hot or cold food\n               and drink.\"\n               (carried forward as the `reason` field on\n                book-appointment -- no fetch call of its own)\n                       |\n                       v\n        [REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v (usualDoctorId branch)                             v (\"anyone is fine\" branch)\n+--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,          |   | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,           |\n|   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |   |   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |   | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |\n+--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v                                                    v\n     found this week?                          [REC] \"We have an opening Friday\n      |            |                                  at 11:00am with Dr Lee.\"\n     yes           no                                      |\n      |            |                                       v\n      v            v                                (continues below at \"picks slot\")\n  [REC] reports  [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything open\n   this week's    this week -- would you like to wait until\n   slot, e.g.     next week, or see another dentist sooner?\"\n   \"We have           |\n   tomorrow at        +-------------------------+\n   10:30am.\"          |                         |\n      |                v                        v\n      |         \"I'd like to see          \"Next week is\n      |          someone sooner.\"          fine, thanks.\"\n      |                |                         |\n      |                v                         v\n      |     +--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------+\n      |     | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,           |   | find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,    |\n      |     |   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |   |   dateFrom=start of next week,       |\n      |     | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |   |   dateTo=end of next week)           |\n      |     +--------------------------------------------+   | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening |\n      |                |                                     +--------------------------------------+\n      |                v                                          |\n      |     [REC] \"Dr Lee has an opening                          v\n      |      this Friday at 11am.\"                    [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n      |                |                                is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n      |                |                                          |\n      +----------------+------------------------------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n        [YOU] \"That works, thanks.\"\n               (picks slot -- no backend call)\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v (returning patient)                                v (first-time patient)\n[REC] \"Could I have your phone            [REC] \"Could I get your full name,\n       number, please?\"                          date of birth, and phone\n[YOU] \"Sure, it's [Phone Number].\"               number, please?\"\n      |                                    [YOU] \"Sure -- [Name], [DOB],\n      v                                           and [Phone Number].\"\n+-----------------------------------------+              |\n| update-patient-phone(patientId, phone)  |              v\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/update-patient-phone |   +-------------------------------------------+\n+-----------------------------------------+   | register-patient(first, last, dob, phone) |\n      |                                       | ROUTE: POST /tools/register-patient       |\n      |                                       +-------------------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      +----------------+-----------------------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n+---------------------------------------------+\n| book-appointment(patientId, doctorId, date, |\n|   startTime, durationMinutes,               |\n|   appointmentType, reason)                  |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/book-appointment         |\n+---------------------------------------------+\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v booked: false                                      v booked: true\n  reasons:                                     [REC] \"Thank you. Your appointment\n  - \"No doctor found with that ID\"                    is booked for [date] at [time]\n  - \"No patient found with that ID\"                   with Dr [Name].\"\n  - \"Requested time falls outside the                        |\n     doctor's working hours\"                          [YOU] \"Okay, thank you. Is there\n  - \"That time overlaps an existing                          anything I need to bring?\"\n     appointment for this doctor.                            |\n     Please choose another.\"                          [REC] \"Please bring your ID and\n  - \"This patient already has another                        any relevant medical or\n     appointment at that time.\"                              dental information.\"\n      |                                                       |\n      v                                                [YOU] \"No problem. Thank you\n  back to find-next-opening                                   for your help.\"\n  (pick a different date/slot)                                |\n                                                        [REC] \"You're very welcome.\n                                                               We'll see you then.\"\n                                                               |\n                                                        [YOU] \"Thank you. Goodbye.\"\n                                                        [REC] \"Goodbye.\"\n                                                               |\n                                                               v\n                                                             DONE",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==================================================================\n   BOOKING A DENTIST APPOINTMENT \n   booking_service/app/main.py\n==================================================================\n\nSTART: phone rings\n  |\n  v\n[REC] \"Good morning, Greenfield Dental Clinic. How can I help you?\"\n[YOU] \"I'd like to make an appointment with a dentist, please.\"\n  |\n  v\n[REC] \"Is this your first time visiting our clinic?\"\n  |\n  +---------------------------------+---------------------------------+\n  | \"No, I've been there before.\"   | \"Yes, this is my first time.\"   |\n  v                                 v\nRETURNING PATIENT                  FIRST-TIME PATIENT\n  |                                 |\n  v                                 v\n[REC] \"Okay. Can I take your        [REC] \"Do you have a preferred\n       name and date of birth,             dentist?\"\n       please?\"                     [YOU] \"Anyone is fine.\"\n[YOU] \"Yes, it's [Name] and                |\n       [DOB].\"                             v\n  |                                  (no lookup call yet -- which doctor\n  v                                  you get is resolved together with\n+---------------------------------+  the availability search further\n| find-patient(first, last, dob)  |  down. Name/DOB aren't needed yet\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-patient |  either -- first-time patients skip\n+---------------------------------+  find-patient entirely, so there's\n  |                                  nothing to ask for until\n  v                                  register-patient, further down.)\nusualDoctorId present?                     |\n  |            |                           |\n yes           no                          |\n  |            |                           |\n  v            +---------------------------+\n+-------------------------------+          |\n| get-doctor(doctorId)          |          |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/get-doctor |          |\n+-------------------------------+          |\n  |                                        |\n  v                                        |\n[REC] \"I see you've been treated           |\n       by Dr Smith before.\"                |\n[YOU] \"Yes, that's right.\"                 |\n  |                                        |\n  +--------------------+-------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n        (doctorId settled for the returning branch;\n         \"anyone is fine\" branch still open)\n                       |\n                       v\n        [REC] \"Thank you. What seems to be the problem?\"\n        [YOU] \"I've had a toothache for the last two days,\n               and it's getting worse.\"\n        [REC] \"Any swelling or severe pain?\"\n        [YOU] \"Some pain, especially with hot or cold food\n               and drink.\"\n               (carried forward as the `reason` field on\n                book-appointment -- no fetch call of its own)\n                       |\n                       v\n        [REC] \"Let me check the dentist's availability.\"\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v (usualDoctorId branch)                             v (\"anyone is fine\" branch)\n+--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------------+\n| find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,          |   | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,           |\n|   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |   |   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |   | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |\n+--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v                                                    v\n     found this week?                          [REC] \"We have an opening Friday\n      |            |                                  at 11:00am with Dr Lee.\"\n     yes           no                                      |\n      |            |                                       v\n      v            v                                (continues below at \"picks slot\")\n  [REC] reports  [REC] \"Dr Smith doesn't have anything open\n   this week's    this week -- would you like to wait until\n   slot, e.g.     next week, or see another dentist sooner?\"\n   \"We have           |\n   tomorrow at        +-------------------------+\n   10:30am.\"          |                         |\n      |                v                        v\n      |         \"I'd like to see          \"Next week is\n      |          someone sooner.\"          fine, thanks.\"\n      |                |                         |\n      |                v                         v\n      |     +--------------------------------------------+   +--------------------------------------+\n      |     | find-next-opening(doctorId=None,           |   | find-next-opening(doctorId=usual,    |\n      |     |   dateFrom=today, dateTo=end of this week) |   |   dateFrom=start of next week,       |\n      |     | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening       |   |   dateTo=end of next week)           |\n      |     +--------------------------------------------+   | ROUTE: POST /tools/find-next-opening |\n      |                |                                     +--------------------------------------+\n      |                v                                          |\n      |     [REC] \"Dr Lee has an opening                          v\n      |      this Friday at 11am.\"                    [REC] \"Dr Smith's next opening\n      |                |                                is Monday at 9:00am.\"\n      |                |                                          |\n      +----------------+------------------------------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n        [YOU] \"That works, thanks.\"\n               (picks slot -- no backend call)\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v (returning patient)                                v (first-time patient)\n[REC] \"Could I have your phone            [REC] \"Could I get your full name,\n       number, please?\"                          date of birth, and phone\n[YOU] \"Sure, it's [Phone Number].\"               number, please?\"\n      |                                    [YOU] \"Sure -- [Name], [DOB],\n      v                                           and [Phone Number].\"\n+-----------------------------------------+              |\n| update-patient-phone(patientId, phone)  |              v\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/update-patient-phone |   +-------------------------------------------+\n+-----------------------------------------+   | register-patient(first, last, dob, phone) |\n      |                                       | ROUTE: POST /tools/register-patient       |\n      |                                       +-------------------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      +----------------+-----------------------------------+\n                       |\n                       v\n+---------------------------------------------+\n| book-appointment(patientId, doctorId, date, |\n|   startTime, durationMinutes,               |\n|   appointmentType, reason)                  |\n| ROUTE: POST /tools/book-appointment         |\n+---------------------------------------------+\n                       |\n      +----------------+----------------------------------+\n      |                                                    |\n      v booked: false                                      v booked: true\n  reasons:                                     [REC] \"Thank you. Your appointment\n  - \"No doctor found with that ID\"                    is booked for [date] at [time]\n  - \"No patient found with that ID\"                   with Dr [Name].\"\n  - \"Requested time falls outside the                        |\n     doctor's working hours\"                          [YOU] \"Okay, thank you. Is there\n  - \"That time overlaps an existing                          anything I need to bring?\"\n     appointment for this doctor.                            |\n     Please choose another.\"                          [REC] \"Please bring your ID and\n  - \"This patient already has another                        any relevant medical or\n     appointment at that time.\"                              dental information.\"\n      |                                                       |\n      v                                                [YOU] \"No problem. Thank you\n  back to find-next-opening                                   for your help.\"\n  (pick a different date/slot)                                |\n                                                        [REC] \"You're very welcome.\n                                                               We'll see you then.\"\n                                                               |\n                                                        [YOU] \"Thank you. Goodbye.\"\n                                                        [REC] \"Goodbye.\"\n                                                               |\n                                                               v\n                                                             DONE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LRhJgm7if6As-gNghLf-K",
