    {
      "id": "TM2lV745oNWeXWgXt65NI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12609.353833446283,
      "y": -2268.053856931552,
      "width": 1940.3997802734375,
      "height": 441.0768202417587,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bE2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 51830989,
      "version": 373,
      "versionNonce": 548823885,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786449667045,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One DB round trip per day \nfetches working hours, time off, and bookings once, then computes slots in Python.\n\nShared logic with future booking\n_get_working_window can be reused by book-appointment, keeping slot validity in one place.\n\nDefensive input handling\nbad dates return {\"found\": false, \"reason\": ...} instead of a 500. \nsince dates here ultimately come from an LLM parsing speech, not a strict form.",
      "fontSize": 39.20682846593411,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One DB round trip per day \nfetches working hours, time off, and bookings once, then computes slots in Python.\n\nShared logic with future booking\n_get_working_window can be reused by book-appointment, keeping slot validity in one place.\n\nDefensive input handling\nbad dates return {\"found\": false, \"reason\": ...} instead of a 500. \nsince dates here ultimately come from an LLM parsing speech, not a strict form.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
