      "text": "Twilio                          Your server\n  │                                  │\n  │ secret = ABC123                  │ secret = ABC123\n  │                                  │\n  ├─ URL + parameters                │\n  │        ↓                         │\n  │    HMAC-SHA1                     │\n  │        ↓                         │\n  │    signature ─────────────────►│\n  │                                  │\n  │                    URL + params  │\n  │                         ↓        │\n  │                     HMAC-SHA1    │\n  │                         ↓        │\n  │                    signature     │\n  │                         │        │\n  │                    compare ◄─────┘\n  │                         ↓\n  │                       match ✅",
