      "text": "| **Google Gemini Live API**\n| Strong, and by far the widest language\ncoverage (97 languages)        | “Orders\nof magnitude cheaper” than GPT-Realtime\nper the comparison sources\n| Less telephony-specific tuning called\nout than either Nova\n|",
