      "text": "| **Amazon Nova Sonic** (original,\n`amazon.nova-sonic-v1:0` — currently\nused by this project) | Good, telephony-\ntuned; launched March 2025\n| ~$3/M input, $12/M output speech\ntokens — roughly **~$0.015/min**\n| Only 5 languages: English, Spanish,\nFrench, Italian, German\n|",
