      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "| **Amazon Nova 2 Sonic** (`amazon.nova-\n2-sonic-v1:0`)\n| Same telephony tuning, plus improved\nturn-taking/tool-calling per AWS | Same\nballpark pricing as original\n(**~$0.015/min**) — AWS public pricing\ndoesn't clearly separate the two\ngenerations | 7 languages (adds\nPortuguese, Hindi); only 3 regions so\nfar; newer, less battle-tested |",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "| **Amazon Nova 2 Sonic** (`amazon.nova-2-sonic-v1:0`)                                        | Same telephony tuning, plus improved turn-taking/tool-calling per AWS | Same ballpark pricing as original (**~$0.015/min**) — AWS public pricing doesn't clearly separate the two generations | 7 languages (adds Portuguese, Hindi); only 3 regions so far; newer, less battle-tested |",
      "autoResize": false,
