      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "========================== MODULE-LEVEL HELPERS ==========================\n(pure functions -- build JSON strings/prompt text, no I/O)\n\n  _build_system_prompt()          _start_prompt_event(name)      _tool_result_event(...)\n        |                                |                              |\n        | called by                      | called by                    | called by\n        v                                v                              v\n  __init__()                      initialize_stream()          send_tool_result_event()\n\n\n========================= BedrockStreamManager ============================\n\n  __init__(tool_executor, model_id, region, system_prompt)\n     |\n     +--> _build_system_prompt()      [only if system_prompt not given]\n     |\n     v\n  +-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n  |  initialize_stream()   <-- called ONCE by the caller (main.py)  |\n  |-------------------------------------------------------------------\n  |   +--> _initialize_client()        builds bedrock_client\n  |   +--> _start_prompt_event()       builds promptStart + tool schemas\n  |   +--> send_raw_event()  x5        SESSION_START, PROMPT_START,\n  |   |                                 SYSTEM content start/text/end\n  |   +==> spawn task: _process_responses()   [runs until is_active=False]\n  |   +==> spawn task: _process_audio_input() [runs until is_active=False]\n  +-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n\n  --------------------- caller-facing \"send_*\" API ---------------------\n  send_audio_content_start_event()  --> send_raw_event()\n  add_audio_chunk(bytes)            --> puts on audio_input_queue\n                                          (drained by _process_audio_input)\n  send_audio_content_end_event()    --> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_start_event()           --> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_result_event()          --> _tool_result_event() -> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_content_end_event()     --> send_raw_event()\n  send_prompt_end_event()           --> send_raw_event()\n  send_session_end_event()          --> send_raw_event()\n                       \\                /\n                        \\              /\n                         v            v\n                 +-----------------------+\n                 |    send_raw_event()   |  <-- EVERY outbound event funnels\n                 +-----------------------+      through here to Bedrock\n\n  ------------------------ background loop #1 ------------------------\n  _process_audio_input()                       [while self.is_active]\n     get() <-- audio_input_queue <-- add_audio_chunk()\n     --> send_raw_event()      (base64 audio chunk sent upstream)\n\n  ------------------------ background loop #2 ------------------------\n  _process_responses()                         [while self.is_active]\n     await_output() from Bedrock, branch on event type:\n        contentStart -----> sets self.role / display_assistant_text\n        textOutput   -----> prints transcript\n        audioOutput  -----> put() -> audio_output_queue (caller drains it)\n        toolUse      -----> stashes tool_name / tool_use_id / content\n        contentEnd(TOOL) -> handle_tool_request()\n                                  |\n                                  v\n                         handle_tool_request(name, content, id)\n                                  |\n                                  +--> asyncio.create_task(...)\n                                  v\n                    _execute_tool_and_send_result()\n                          |\n                          +--> _execute_tool()\n                          |        |\n                          |        +--> endCallTool: sets call_should_end\n                          |        |               (handled inline)\n                          |        +--> else: self.tool_executor(name, args)\n                          |                 (INJECTED -- e.g. HTTP call out\n                          |                  to booking_service)\n                          +--> send_tool_start_event()\n                          +--> send_tool_result_event()\n                          +--> send_tool_content_end_event()\n\n  ------------------------------ teardown ------------------------------\n  close()   <-- called ONCE by the caller\n     cancel: pending_tool_tasks[], audio_input_task\n     await audio_input_task (bounded, 1s)      \n     --> send_audio_content_end_event()\n     --> send_prompt_end_event()\n     --> send_session_end_event()\n     stream_response.input_stream.close()\n     await response_task (bounded, 2s)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "========================== MODULE-LEVEL HELPERS ==========================\n(pure functions -- build JSON strings/prompt text, no I/O)\n\n  _build_system_prompt()          _start_prompt_event(name)      _tool_result_event(...)\n        |                                |                              |\n        | called by                      | called by                    | called by\n        v                                v                              v\n  __init__()                      initialize_stream()          send_tool_result_event()\n\n\n========================= BedrockStreamManager ============================\n\n  __init__(tool_executor, model_id, region, system_prompt)\n     |\n     +--> _build_system_prompt()      [only if system_prompt not given]\n     |\n     v\n  +-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n  |  initialize_stream()   <-- called ONCE by the caller (main.py)  |\n  |-------------------------------------------------------------------\n  |   +--> _initialize_client()        builds bedrock_client\n  |   +--> _start_prompt_event()       builds promptStart + tool schemas\n  |   +--> send_raw_event()  x5        SESSION_START, PROMPT_START,\n  |   |                                 SYSTEM content start/text/end\n  |   +==> spawn task: _process_responses()   [runs until is_active=False]\n  |   +==> spawn task: _process_audio_input() [runs until is_active=False]\n  +-----------------------------------------------------------------+\n\n  --------------------- caller-facing \"send_*\" API ---------------------\n  send_audio_content_start_event()  --> send_raw_event()\n  add_audio_chunk(bytes)            --> puts on audio_input_queue\n                                          (drained by _process_audio_input)\n  send_audio_content_end_event()    --> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_start_event()           --> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_result_event()          --> _tool_result_event() -> send_raw_event()\n  send_tool_content_end_event()     --> send_raw_event()\n  send_prompt_end_event()           --> send_raw_event()\n  send_session_end_event()          --> send_raw_event()\n                       \\                /\n                        \\              /\n                         v            v\n                 +-----------------------+\n                 |    send_raw_event()   |  <-- EVERY outbound event funnels\n                 +-----------------------+      through here to Bedrock\n\n  ------------------------ background loop #1 ------------------------\n  _process_audio_input()                       [while self.is_active]\n     get() <-- audio_input_queue <-- add_audio_chunk()\n     --> send_raw_event()      (base64 audio chunk sent upstream)\n\n  ------------------------ background loop #2 ------------------------\n  _process_responses()                         [while self.is_active]\n     await_output() from Bedrock, branch on event type:\n        contentStart -----> sets self.role / display_assistant_text\n        textOutput   -----> prints transcript\n        audioOutput  -----> put() -> audio_output_queue (caller drains it)\n        toolUse      -----> stashes tool_name / tool_use_id / content\n        contentEnd(TOOL) -> handle_tool_request()\n                                  |\n                                  v\n                         handle_tool_request(name, content, id)\n                                  |\n                                  +--> asyncio.create_task(...)\n                                  v\n                    _execute_tool_and_send_result()\n                          |\n                          +--> _execute_tool()\n                          |        |\n                          |        +--> endCallTool: sets call_should_end\n                          |        |               (handled inline)\n                          |        +--> else: self.tool_executor(name, args)\n                          |                 (INJECTED -- e.g. HTTP call out\n                          |                  to booking_service)\n                          +--> send_tool_start_event()\n                          +--> send_tool_result_event()\n                          +--> send_tool_content_end_event()\n\n  ------------------------------ teardown ------------------------------\n  close()   <-- called ONCE by the caller\n     cancel: pending_tool_tasks[], audio_input_task\n     await audio_input_task (bounded, 1s)      \n     --> send_audio_content_end_event()\n     --> send_prompt_end_event()\n     --> send_session_end_event()\n     stream_response.input_stream.close()\n     await response_task (bounded, 2s)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "0W1mchhjJ87Pais6hj8Nn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 32251.581774888207,
      "y": -381.14297277631283,
      "width": 1016.399658203125,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1475540336,
      "version": 423,
      "versionNonce": 1524890565,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787692731999,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- _START_SESSION_EVENT — opens the Bedrock bidirectional session; \nsets inference config (maxTokens, topP, temperature)\n\n- prompt_event (from _start_prompt_event()) — opens the prompt; \ndeclares audio/text output config (voice tiffany, 24kHz) \nand registers all 7 tool schemas the model can call\n\n- text_content_start — opens a TEXT/SYSTEM-role content block, \ntagged with content_name\n\n- text_content — sends the actual system prompt text \n(the receptionist instructions) into that block\n\n- text_content_end — closes that content block, \nfinalizing the system prompt as context before any audio starts",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- _START_SESSION_EVENT — opens the Bedrock bidirectional session; \nsets inference config (maxTokens, topP, temperature)\n\n- prompt_event (from _start_prompt_event()) — opens the prompt; \ndeclares audio/text output config (voice tiffany, 24kHz) \nand registers all 7 tool schemas the model can call\n\n- text_content_start — opens a TEXT/SYSTEM-role content block, \ntagged with content_name\n\n- text_content — sends the actual system prompt text \n(the receptionist instructions) into that block\n\n- text_content_end — closes that content block, \nfinalizing the system prompt as context before any audio starts",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "2eWIbps2om5UnqCG1P79m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 38955.197806083685,
