    },
    {
      "id": "6VZTH7glnV3bI5wOeqt7c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 34900.686838441376,
      "y": -999.1328859196872,
      "width": 1878.8017578125,
      "height": 1750,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bR6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 966044528,
      "version": 297,
      "versionNonce": 813748101,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787692746364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Function                             | Use                                                                             |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _build_system_prompt()               | Fills today's date into the receptionist script template                        |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _start_prompt_event()                | Builds the promptStart event, including all 7 tool schemas                      |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _tool_result_event()                 | Serializes a tool's return value into the toolResult event shape                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| __init__()                           | Wires queues, IDs, state flags; no I/O yet                                      |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _initialize_client()                 | Creates the BedrockRuntimeClient with region/credentials                        |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| initialize_stream()                  | Opens the stream, sends session/prompt/system-prompt setup, launches both       |\n|                                       | background loops                                                               |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_raw_event()                     | Single choke point that actually writes bytes to input_stream                   |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_audio_content_start_event()     | Tells Bedrock an audio content block is starting                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| add_audio_chunk()                    | Entry point for caller to hand in raw mic bytes                                 |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _process_audio_input()               | Background loop: drains the audio queue, base64s + sends each chunk             |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_audio_content_end_event()       | Closes the audio content block                                                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_start_event()              | Opens a TOOL content block tied to a tool_use_id                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_result_event()             | Sends the tool's JSON result back into that block                               |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_content_end_event()        | Closes the TOOL content block                                                   |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_prompt_end_event()              | Ends the whole prompt                                                           |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_session_end_event()             | Ends the whole session (flips is_active=False)                                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _process_responses()                 | Background loop: reads every Bedrock event, routes by type, prints transcripts, |\n|                                     | queues audio out                                                                 |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| handle_tool_request()                | Fires off tool execution as a tracked async task so the response loop isn't     |\n|                                     | blocked                                                                          |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _execute_tool()                      | Maps tool name -> canonical name, special-cases endCallTool, else delegates to  |\n|                                       | the injected tool_executor in a thread executor                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _execute_tool_and_send_result()      | Runs a tool then sends start/result/end events back to Bedrock                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| close()                              | Graceful shutdown: cancels tasks, ends content/prompt/session, closes the       |\n|                                       | stream                                                                         |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Function                             | Use                                                                             |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _build_system_prompt()               | Fills today's date into the receptionist script template                        |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _start_prompt_event()                | Builds the promptStart event, including all 7 tool schemas                      |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _tool_result_event()                 | Serializes a tool's return value into the toolResult event shape                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| __init__()                           | Wires queues, IDs, state flags; no I/O yet                                      |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _initialize_client()                 | Creates the BedrockRuntimeClient with region/credentials                        |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| initialize_stream()                  | Opens the stream, sends session/prompt/system-prompt setup, launches both       |\n|                                       | background loops                                                               |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_raw_event()                     | Single choke point that actually writes bytes to input_stream                   |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_audio_content_start_event()     | Tells Bedrock an audio content block is starting                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| add_audio_chunk()                    | Entry point for caller to hand in raw mic bytes                                 |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _process_audio_input()               | Background loop: drains the audio queue, base64s + sends each chunk             |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_audio_content_end_event()       | Closes the audio content block                                                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_start_event()              | Opens a TOOL content block tied to a tool_use_id                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_result_event()             | Sends the tool's JSON result back into that block                               |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_tool_content_end_event()        | Closes the TOOL content block                                                   |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_prompt_end_event()              | Ends the whole prompt                                                           |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| send_session_end_event()             | Ends the whole session (flips is_active=False)                                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _process_responses()                 | Background loop: reads every Bedrock event, routes by type, prints transcripts, |\n|                                     | queues audio out                                                                 |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| handle_tool_request()                | Fires off tool execution as a tracked async task so the response loop isn't     |\n|                                     | blocked                                                                          |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _execute_tool()                      | Maps tool name -> canonical name, special-cases endCallTool, else delegates to  |\n|                                       | the injected tool_executor in a thread executor                                |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| _execute_tool_and_send_result()      | Runs a tool then sends start/result/end events back to Bedrock                  |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| close()                              | Graceful shutdown: cancels tasks, ends content/prompt/session, closes the       |\n|                                       | stream                                                                         |\n+-------------------------------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------+",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
